                                                "sense_id": "edcf2265-f9bb-3938-90ba-574481634093",
                                                "text": "That accounts for my having the dress, but it don't account for the piece that you left sticking to the rose-bush under Mrs. Lander's bed-room winder, which piece I took off that morning, and which piece I matched with the dress after you pitched it at me over them bannisters […]"
